title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/viewer:seek
catalog: GUI command
target: viewer:seek
summary: File: seek the previewed media by a signed number of seconds

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``viewer`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``left`` → ``viewer:seek -10`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``right`` → ``viewer:seek +10`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``shift+left`` → ``viewer:seek -60`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``shift+right`` → ``viewer:seek +60`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
